royed all of the  relationships that he had and it made  everyone forget peter parker existed the  kid had pretty much done the forgot  about dre song but in real life and now  no one knows who he is beyond this it  includes all of the avengers and as they  know peter on a personal level he  wouldn't be part of the group in far  from home we also learned that nick fury  and shield were well aware of who he was  and therefore everyone in the government  is also under this spell too i'm  guessing this includes the scrolls and  spider-man's identity will be completely  hidden from absolutely everyone i'm not  sure what happens with the cabinet at  school that has peter and spider-man's  face side by side but the way that this  spell works is that it basically  hypnotizes people just in the same way  that during an act on stage a magician  can ask someone their name and they're  unable to say it the spell stops you  tapping into the part of your brain that  retains this information now how this  would work with the stand and video  recordings of say the beagle's reports  i'm not too sure but i can imagine that  it would go one of two ways either  someone walking past the stand or seeing  a video would simply go into a trance  and skip past it or it would work like  the silence in doctor who in case you  haven't seen them they're basically  aliens that you completely forget about  the second that you look away from them  you can be staring one in the face  absolutely terrified and then when you  turn around it'll be like you never saw  them now we probably won't learn exactly  how this works until the next movie but  the way that it worked in the comics was  that it pretty much just stopped people  from remembering the details thus peter  is truly just once more your friendly  neighborhood spider-man and much in the  same way that daredevil operates he's  just classed as a vigilante that lives  in new york this is hammered home by the  report that jameson gives at the end in  which he says that spider-man destroyed  the statue of liberty and that the  vigilante is concealing his identity  although it's a downer i do think it  very much gives the character a fresh  start and it means that they can  introduce new people and relationships  such as harry osborn black cat gwen  stacy and really anyone who we can  slowly reveal the truth to over time he  could also spark up somewhat of a  friendship with happy asset to both  visit mae's grave at the end and  potentially they could come to know each  other once more either way peter is now  fully on his own in a new apartment no  longer going off with mj and ned to  boston and whilst one door closes  another one opens for the future now i  actually have a suspicion that sony and  marvel put this in place just in case  they couldn't come to an agreement over  whether they'd be working on films  together in the future being completely  disconnected from the other marvel  heroes would mean that he would still be  classed as being in the mcu but they  wouldn't have to worry about the  contractual things and stories clashing  we do know that tom holland has signed  on for more movies as the webhead though  and i am excited for the direction of  the franchise now we don't know if the  spell actually extends beyond the mcu  and potentially it could also go into  other universes if sony ever picked up  the amazing spider-man 3 or potentially  spider-man 4 we could explore the  repercussions of that i think it would  add a lot of drama to toby's life if he  returned home to find that his mj had  forgotten who he was too and he could  even team up with andrew in the future  in the same way that spider gwen is  having another adventure with miles now  just before peter is thrown into the  mirror dimension strange pushes him out  of his astral form he goes to grab the  box but peter moves it out the way and  this is because his spider sense is  naturally protecting his body from harm  his spider sens