y love that the ending of  the movie is about healing the villains  instead of taking them down now because  of this most wouldn't have died upon  returning home norman osborne wouldn't  have impaled himself with his own glider  electro wouldn't have overcharged and  sandman wouldn't have turned to a life  of crime i'm not sure exactly what would  have happened with doc though as he  would have still had to have drowned  that miniature son but he may have  returned to an earlier moment i do think  that he might have just returned to the  moment he was afraid to die regain  control and then have drowned the son  anyway as he was definitely someone who  took responsibility for his actions how  this would affect those realities has  already been explained in end game and  an alternate timeline would simply  branch off whilst the rhyming garfield  films will continue in another reality  now another big thing that's happening  in the mcu is that they're finally  finally acknowledging the netflix shows  kingpin showed up at the end of hawkeye  episode 5 and matt murdock also appears  as peter's lawyer early on in the film  though we don't know what's happening in  the finale of hawkeye just yet we do  know that ekko is getting a solo show  down the line and it's likely that this  will be based on her origin story in the  comics we learned that kingpin killed  her father and in his dying breath he  asked the crime boss to take care of his  daughter she became one of his best  assassins whereas the show pinned her  dad's death on clint in the comics it  was daredevil who took the blame however  she discovered the truth eventually and  turn on her surrogate father which i do  believe will be the main plot of her  solo series they surely have to bring  daredevil into that too and there are  also rumors that he's gonna be in the  she-hulk series as well now though the  spell is supposed to have brought people  across at nupeta was spider-man venom  definitely didn't as he never met him  however the multiverse is a strange  thing and potentially when it broke open  because a venom in one universe knows  who he is every venom in every universe  had somewhat of a way to travel across  the tom hardy version possibly only got  taken over because he was currently  doing something that would massively  alter eddie's consciousness now lastly i  want to talk about doctor strange and  what happens next with him he doesn't  actually know why the multiverse is  broken open as he too would have been  hypnotized in forgetting it was  connected to be there therefore i think  that in the post-credits scene when we  catch him reaching out to wonder he's  going as a friend because he's confused  as to why this is happening this could  lead into the pair learning about peter  and in doing so they'll find out about  other versions of the character in other  realities this could lead to her  realizing that there are other versions  of her children and it could end up  leading us all into the multiverse of  madness say obviously i'd love to hear  your thoughts and if you have other  questions i'm sure someone much smarter  than me can answer them so make sure you  leave them below we are running a  competition right now and giving away  three copies of the spider-man 4k  trilogies on the 30th of december all  you have to do to be on the chance of  winning is like the video make sure you  subscribe with notifications on and drop  a comment below with your thoughts on  the video we pick the comments at random  at the end of the month and the winners  of the last one are on screen right now  so if that's you then message me on  twitter heavy spoilers if you want  something else to watch then make sure  you check out our breaking of the full  movie which will be linked on screen  right now we talk about the plot the  ending and what could be happening in  the future so definitely head over there  right after this if not then thanks for  singing through the video 